    "en": "Engineer — Rope & Repair"
  },
  {
    "source": "Pasang tali [E] → Panjat [F] → tahan [E] di lubang → Turun [Q]. Jangan biarkan tali 0%! Tahan [C] perbaiki tali, [B] tarik rekan.",
    "en": "Attach rope [E] → Climb [F] → hold [E] on holes → Descend [Q]. Never let rope hit 0%! Hold [C] to repair rope, [B] to pull crew."
